# SS-02 - Numbered TODO and GitHub tracking adoption
Workstream ID: SS-02
GitHub issue: https://github.com/Zanark/StonksSniper/issues/2
Status: DONE
Milestone: M1
Dependencies: SS-01

## Purpose
Maintain one public-safe workstream to one issue to one dedicated Project issue item.

## Tasks
- [x] Verify Zanark identity, public repository permissions and existing tracking.
- [x] Create and link the dedicated Project; discover actual status options.
- [x] Define local source of truth, public boundary and stable workstream IDs.
- [x] Preview, pilot one workstream and rerun without duplicates.
- [x] Apply all mappings and verify bodies, issue states, Project statuses and backlinks.
- [x] Exercise conflict detection and record explicit sync usage.

## Acceptance criteria
- Every actual workstream has one matching issue and non-draft Project item.
- Index/ledger are excluded; unexpected remote edits stop writes; no scheduling enabled.

## Completion evidence
- Project https://github.com/users/Zanark/projects/14 exists and is linked.
- TODO/tracking.json records adoption and actual per-stream mappings after sync.
- All 18 mappings were created, read back and subsequently verified again with
  their original issue and Project item identities; no duplicate issues/items.
- Conflict, preview-no-write and bounded eventual-consistency tests pass.
- docs/development.md records preview/apply usage, public boundary and failure behavior.
- Human acceptance remains separate; no scheduler or publication workflow was enabled.

## Completion log
- 2026-11-11: Established adoption and implementation; remote sync verification in progress.
- 2026-11-11: Completed all 18 mappings and reran safely. One rerun stopped on
  HTTP 503; a later explicit rerun verified every mapping without recreating identities.
